            <h2 class="section-title">Graduation Balloon Decorations: Custom Arches, Bouquets &amp; Delivery</h2>
            <div class="lead-text">
              <p>Graduation day deserves décor that feels as big as the achievement. Balloons Lane designs custom graduation balloon decorations — arches, bouquets, columns and centerpieces — for preschool, high school, college and university celebrations across New York City, New Jersey and Staten Island.</p>
              <p>Every design is built around your school colors and theme: classic black and gold for an elegant look, or fully personalized displays featuring the graduate's name, class year and school logo. We deliver and set everything up on site, so your venue is photo-ready before the first guest arrives.</p>
            </div>
            <h3 class="sub-title">Trending Class of 2025 Graduation Balloon Themes</h3>
            <div class="lead-text">
              <p>The right color palette ties the whole celebration together. Bold combinations like red and black or red and purple make a strong statement, while black and gold, green and gold, and navy with rose gold keep the look elegant and timeless.</p>
              <p>Personalize the display with graduation cap and foil balloons printed with the graduate's name, class year or school colors. For preschool and pre-K graduations, playful emoji, princess and character balloons add a fun touch younger graduates love.</p>
              <p>Scale the décor to your venue: jumbo balloons, full arches and columns for large college and university ceremonies — and mini balloons, bubble balloons and air-filled centerpieces for intimate gatherings. Every order arrives pre-inflated and ready to display, with confetti balloons, garlands and custom helium bouquets available to complete the setup.</p>
            </div>
            <h4 class="sub-title-sm">Personalized Graduation Balloon Décor for a One-of-a-Kind Celebration</h4>
            <div class="lead-text">
              <p>Custom mylar balloons printed with the graduate's name, year or school logo turn beautiful décor into a keepsake. They anchor centerpieces and gift tables beautifully, from elementary school ceremonies to university commencements.</p>
              <p>Photo balloons are another favorite — snapshots from the graduate's journey woven into the arrangement, paired with helium balloons or tucked inside a stuffed balloon for an interactive display. Add floating LED balloons or confetti-filled designs for extra sparkle in every photo.</p>
              <p>Finish with a congratulatory balloon carrying a personal message, and let our team handle the rest — design, delivery and full professional setup, including rush delivery when you need it fast.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
